@startuml
title RAG SOC CI/CD Pipeline (GitHub Actions)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam participantStyle rectangle
skinparam noteFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A90E2

participant "GitHub\nRepository" as Repo
participant "GitHub Actions\nController" as Controller
participant "Hosted Runners\n(ubuntu-latest)" as Hosted
participant "Self-Hosted Runners\n(K8s Pod)" as SelfHosted
participant "Harbor\nRegistry" as Harbor
participant "K8s\nStaging" as Staging
participant "K8s\nProduction" as Prod
participant "Prometheus\n+ Grafana" as Monitoring

== Trigger (Push / PR) ==

Repo -> Controller : Webhook (push / pull_request)
activate Controller

== Lint Stage (Hosted) ==

Controller -> Hosted : lint-ruff job
activate Hosted
Hosted -> Hosted : ruff check + format
Hosted -> Hosted : mypy --strict
Hosted --> Repo : Upload lint report (artifact)
deactivate Hosted

note right: Блокировка PR\nпри провале

== Unit Test Stage (Hosted) ==

Controller -> Hosted : test-unit job
activate Hosted
Hosted -> Hosted : pytest --cov --cov-fail-under=50
Hosted --> Repo : Upload coverage + JUnit report
deactivate Hosted

note right: Блокировка мержа\nпри coverage < 50%

== Integration Test Stage (Self-Hosted) ==

Controller -> SelfHosted : test-integration job
activate SelfHosted
SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : Запуск testcontainers\n(Postgres, Redis, Qdrant)
SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : pytest integration tests
SelfHosted --> Repo : Upload JUnit report
deactivate SelfHosted

note right: Блокировка деплоя\nв staging

== SAST Stage (Hosted) ==

Controller -> Hosted : security-sast job
activate Hosted
Hosted -> Hosted : Semgrep --config auto
Hosted --> Repo : Upload SARIF report
deactivate Hosted

note right: Warning при critical\n(блокировка после 3 раз)

== Build Stage (Self-Hosted) ==

Controller -> SelfHosted : build job
activate SelfHosted
SelfHosted -> Harbor : docker login
activate Harbor
SelfHosted -> Harbor : docker build + push\n(image:tag=commit_sha)
Harbor -> Harbor : Trivy scan\n(уязвимости образов)
deactivate Harbor
SelfHosted --> Repo : Upload image manifest
deactivate SelfHosted

== SCA Stage (Hosted) ==

Controller -> Hosted : security-sca job
activate Hosted
Hosted -> Hosted : pip-audit --severity high
Hosted --> Repo : Upload SCA report (JSON)
deactivate Hosted

note right: Warning при critical\n(блокировка после 3 раз)

== Deploy Staging (Self-Hosted) ==

Controller -> SelfHosted : deploy-staging job
activate SelfHosted
SelfHosted -> Staging : helm upgrade --install\n(namespace: staging)
activate Staging
Staging -> Staging : Rolling update\n(K8s Deployment)
deactivate Staging
SelfHosted --> Repo : Update deployment status
deactivate SelfHosted

note right: Environment: staging\n(auto-deploy)

== DAST Stage (Hosted) ==

Controller -> Hosted : validate-dast job
activate Hosted
Hosted -> Staging : OWASP ZAP API scan\n(openapi.json)
Hosted --> Repo : Upload DAST report (HTML)
deactivate Hosted

note right: Блокировка prod\nпри High/Critical

== E2E Functional Test (Self-Hosted) ==

Controller -> SelfHosted : validate-e2e-functional job
activate SelfHosted
SelfHosted -> Staging : pytest tests/e2e/functional/
SelfHosted --> Repo : Upload JUnit report
deactivate SelfHosted

note right: Блокировка prod\nпри провале тестов

== E2E Quality Test - RAGAS (Self-Hosted) ==

Controller -> SelfHosted : validate-e2e-quality job
activate SelfHosted
SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : pytest + RAGAS\n(faithfulness, correctness)
SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : extract_ragas_metrics.py
SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : check_quality_gates.py
SelfHosted --> Repo : Upload metrics (JSON)
deactivate SelfHosted

note right: Блокировка prod при\nfaithfulness < 0.8\ncorrectness < 0.75

== Quality Gates Check ==

alt Quality Gates Failed

Repo -> Repo : Stop pipeline
Repo -> Repo : Notify (Slack/Email)

else Quality Gates Passed

Repo -> Repo : Require manual approval\n(production environment)

end

== Deploy Production - Manual Approval (Self-Hosted) ==

note over Repo: Manual approval\n(maintainer role required)

Controller -> SelfHosted : deploy-prod job
activate SelfHosted

== Canary 10% ==

SelfHosted -> Prod : helm upgrade\n(canary.weight=10)
activate Prod
Prod -> Prod : Istio VirtualService\n(10% traffic)
deactivate Prod

SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : Wait 60s
SelfHosted -> Prod : Smoke tests (canary)
activate Prod

alt Smoke Tests Pass

Prod --> SelfHosted : OK
deactivate Prod

else Smoke Tests Fail

Prod --> SelfHosted : FAIL
deactivate Prod
SelfHosted -> Prod : helm rollback
activate Prod
Prod -> Prod : Rollback to previous version
deactivate Prod
SelfHosted --> Repo : Notify failure (rollback)
deactivate SelfHosted

end

== Rollout 50% ==

SelfHosted -> Prod : helm upgrade\n(canary.weight=50)
activate Prod
Prod -> Prod : Istio VirtualService\n(50% traffic)
deactivate Prod

SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : Wait 60s
SelfHosted -> Prod : Smoke tests (50%)
activate Prod

alt Smoke Tests Pass

Prod --> SelfHosted : OK
deactivate Prod

else Smoke Tests Fail

Prod --> SelfHosted : FAIL
deactivate Prod
SelfHosted -> Prod : helm rollback
activate Prod
Prod -> Prod : Rollback to previous version
deactivate Prod
SelfHosted --> Repo : Notify failure (rollback)
deactivate SelfHosted

end

== Rollout 100% ==

SelfHosted -> Prod : helm upgrade\n(canary.weight=100)
activate Prod
Prod -> Prod : Istio VirtualService\n(100% traffic)
deactivate Prod

SelfHosted -> SelfHosted : Wait 60s
SelfHosted -> Prod : Final smoke tests
activate Prod

alt Smoke Tests Pass

Prod --> SelfHosted : OK
deactivate Prod
SelfHosted --> Repo : Update deployment status (production)

else Smoke Tests Fail

Prod --> SelfHosted : FAIL
deactivate Prod
SelfHosted -> Prod : helm rollback
activate Prod
Prod -> Prod : Rollback to previous version
deactivate Prod
SelfHosted --> Repo : Notify failure (rollback)
deactivate SelfHosted

end

deactivate SelfHosted
deactivate Controller

== Post-Deploy ==

Prod -> Monitoring : Экспорт метрик\n(latency, error rate, RPS)
activate Monitoring
Monitoring -> Monitoring : Дашборд:\nRAG SOC Production Overview
deactivate Monitoring

note bottom: Полный цикл: 20–30 мин\n(для типичного PR в main)


== Hosted Runners (ubuntu-latest) используются для лёгких jobs: lint, unit-test, SAST, SCA, DAST. ==
== Self-Hosted Runners (K8s Pods) используются для тяжёлых jobs: integration-test, build, deploy, e2e-test, quality-test. ==
== Manual Approval требуется только для deploy-prod (настройка Environment Protection Rules в GitHub). ==
== Canary-деплой реализован через Istio VirtualService (10% → 50% → 100%) с smoke tests после каждого этапа. ==
== Auto-rollback срабатывает при провале smoke tests на любом этапе canary. ==

@enduml